#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Tsurumi"
msgid "So that was the Florist of Sai..."
msgstr "Entonces ese era el Florista de Sai..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Saejima"
msgid "Hey. What'd ya just say 'bout the Florist?"
msgstr "Oye, ¿puedo preguntarte algo?\\r\n¿Qué dijiste sobre el Florista?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Tsurumi"
msgid "Uh, what? Nothing, nothing at all!"
msgstr "¿Eh? No, no dije nada de eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Saejima"
msgid "I know what I heard. Don't lie to me!"
msgstr "¡Mientes! Sé que lo dijiste hace un momento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Tsurumi"
msgid "Please cut me some slack. Around here, a slip of the tongue\\r\ncould cost a guy... well, his tongue. Or his life!"
msgstr "Por favor, no... Si se descubre que dije algo,\\r\nestoy en problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Saejima"
msgid "Relax. I ain't no snitch."
msgstr "¿En problemas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Tsurumi"
msgid "Well then, uh, if I let you in on my secret,\\r\ndo you promise not to tell anyone?"
msgstr "Bueno, entonces, eh, si te cuento mi secreto,\\r\n¿Prometes no decírselo a nadie?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Saejima"
msgid "I can try, but no promises."
msgstr "No puedo prometerlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Tsurumi"
msgid "Then we have a problem here. Sorry, but my lips are sealed."
msgstr "Eso es un problema. Entonces, no hablaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Tsurumi"
msgid "Have a nice life. And please don't ever talk to me again."
msgstr "Así que, adiós. Y por favor, no me vuelvas a hablar nunca más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Saejima"
msgid "Sunnuva..."
msgstr "Hijo de..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Saejima"
msgid "I promise. Won't tell a soul."
msgstr "Sí, lo prometo. No diré nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Tsurumi"
msgid "Okay, I guess I'll trust you. Keeping it a secret is killing me, anyway."
msgstr "Está bien, confiaré en ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Tsurumi"
msgid "I'm on a city crew that was doing some work on the manhole over in Children's Park. That's when I found it."
msgstr "Soy un obrero que trabaja en la construcción del alcantarillado del parque infantil. Ahí fue cuando lo encontré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Saejima"
msgid "Found what?"
msgstr "¿Encontrar qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Tsurumi"
msgid "A subterranean pleasure district. But they only let in\\r\nthe super rich, and even then just a select few elites.\\r\nI thought it was all an urban legend, but it's real."
msgstr "Un distrito de entretenimiento subterráneo\\r\ndel que solo los adinerados pueden entrar, según los rumores."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Saejima"
msgid "How'd ya find it?"
msgstr "¿Cómo lo encontraste?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Tsurumi"
msgid "Well, uh, I was sneaking a nap down in the manhole\\r\nwhen I heard someone come in."
msgstr "Estaba descansando en la alcantarilla, cuando escuché a alguien entrar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Saejima"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "¿Quién?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Tsurumi"
msgid "I think it was the big cheese himself: the Florist of Sai.\\r\nHe's the info broker who calls the shots down there."
msgstr "Probablemente, el Florista de Sai. Es el que maneja\\r\nel distrito de entretenimiento subterráneo\\r\ny es conocido por ser un informante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Tsurumi"
msgid "He was wearing some real flashy clothes. The kind you see\\r\non magazines in the waiting room at the dentist's office."
msgstr "Su apariencia llamativa lo delató.\\r\nEra idéntico al que vi en una revista hace un tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Saejima"
msgid "And?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Qué más?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Tsurumi"
msgid "He kept on going down the tunnel until he disappeared."
msgstr "Luego, simplemente siguió más allá del alcantarillado\\r\ny desapareció en la oscuridad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Tsurumi"
msgid "When I took a look later, I found a door at the end."
msgstr "Cuando eché un vistazo más tarde, encontré que al\\r\nfinal del alcantarillado, había una puerta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Saejima"
msgid "Where's it go?"
msgstr "¿Y qué hay detrás de la puerta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Tsurumi"
msgid "Dunno. I didn't open it."
msgstr "No lo sé..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Saejima"
msgid "The hell! Why not?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Tsurumi"
msgid "It was a really heavy door. I couldn't get it to budge.\\r\nI bet there's some trick to it only the Florist knows."
msgstr "No pude, era muy pesada y no pude abrirla.\\r\nPuede que haya algún tipo de mecanismo\\r\ny tal vez solo el Florista sepa abrirla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Tsurumi"
msgid "If the rumors about the Florist are true, I'd rather keep\\r\nmy nose on my face than poke it where it doesn't belong."
msgstr "Además, hay muchos rumores sobre el Florista.\\r\nSi investigas demasiado, podrías estar en peligro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Tsurumi"
msgid "Then again, that stuff's all hearsay and tabloid gossip.\\r\nNo idea where the legend ends and the truth begins."
msgstr "Bueno, solo estoy repitiendo rumores y cosas que he\\r\nescuchado en revistas y demás, así que no sé si son ciertos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Tsurumi"
msgid "All I know is what I saw with my own eyes. Just remember,\\r\nyou promised to keep this a secret."
msgstr "Eso es todo lo que sé. Por favor, recuerda mantenerlo en secreto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Saejima"
msgid "Don't worry, I ain't tellin' no one."
msgstr "Puedes confiar en mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Saejima"
msgid "(Assuming this guy ain't feedin' me a big crock of shit, I oughta check out the manhole in Children's Park.)"
msgstr "(La alcantarilla del parque infantil.\\r\nTendré que ir a investigar)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_Tsurumi"
msgid "Oh no, not you again. Please leave me alone.\\r\nI don't want to get mixed up in any trouble."
msgstr "¿Otra vez tú? No quiero que me metas en problemas,\\r\nasí que no me hables demasiado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Saejima"
msgid "Sorry. Gotta know what you know."
msgstr "Lo siento. Pero necesito saber más sobre lo que has dicho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Tsurumi"
msgid "Well then, if I let you in on my secret, do you promise\\r\nnot to tell anyone else?"
msgstr "Bueno, ¿puedo confiar en que no dirás\\r\nnada de lo que te cuente?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Tsurumi"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr "Lo prometo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Tsurumi"
msgid "No promises."
msgstr "No lo prometo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Tsurumi"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr "Lo prometo."

